Implementation:

```tcl
proc wv_count_by_pattern {fsdb_path pattern} {
    set fo [sx_open_sim_file_read $fsdb_path]
    set waves [sx_signal $pattern]
    catch {sx_close_sim_file $fo}
    return [llength $waves]
}
```

The proc opens the FSDB, uses the `sx_signal` batch-selection API to obtain the list of matching wave handles, closes the file, and returns `llength` of the list (which is `0` when no signal matches).

